# TO-GaussMap (Concept)
{ set { "TO-GaussMap" <id> <TO-GaussMap>
      "Gauss Map" <name> <TO-GaussMap>
      "concept" <entity_type> <TO-GaussMap>
      "dynam-systems" <category> <TO-GaussMap>
      "transfer-operator" <subcategory> <TO-GaussMap>
      "The Gauss map T: (0,1) → (0,1) defined by\n  T(x) = {1/x} = 1/x - ⌊1/x⌋ (fractional part)\nThis is the classical continued fraction map.\nThe transfer operator L_s is associated with the Gauss map's iterates.\n" <definition> <TO-GaussMap>
