      "Studies the Selberg zeta function for PSL(2,Z) via transfer operators on\nthe Gauss map. Establishes the identity Z_S(s) = det(1-L_s) det(1+L_s) for Re(s)>1,\nwhere L_s is the weighted transfer operator.\n" <abstract> <mayer-1991>
